thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4addf8381d1a3abfEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4d6b3e166b2e41dfEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_S_LOW_MurderTribunal_Prison_FistLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_S_LOW_MurderTribunal_Prison_FistLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_S_LOW_MurderTribunal_Prison_FistLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9613a34f-98be-47af-a963-bb5b27868c31</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9613a34f-98be-47af-a963-bb5b27868c31\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9613a34f-98be-47af-a963-bb5b27868c31\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orvil\" title=\"Orvil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Orvil.png/25px-Portrait_Orvil.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Orvil.png/38px-Portrait_Orvil.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Orvil.png/50px-Portrait_Orvil.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fist Orvil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Orvil.png/25px-Portrait_Orvil.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Portrait_Orvil.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orvil\" title=\"Orvil\">Fist Orvil</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaalist_Crypt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bhaalist Crypt\">Bhaalist Crypt</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1244&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;548</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dear Quil, do you remember me? We spent a sweet evening chatting to one another after you gave a heart-stopping performance at <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Nashkel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nashkel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Nashkel\">Nashkel</a></span> Inn, when I was on patrol tour.\n</p><p>I heard you were headed to <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> to get your songbook published, and I've pre-ordered my copy. If you'd forgive a humble [Fist's boldness, I send you in writing what I wasn't bold enough to say on that night: each one of your scales is a gem, your eyes shine brighter than your throat-fire. Images of you have beset me since we met.\n</p><p>You must have many suitors, as a scholar of love-ballads, but perhaps when you get to the Gate, you'd meet me one starry night in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>?\n</p><p>[The letter is clearly unfinished, the Fist intending to write more before sending it.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This note is one of the few references to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" title=\"Quil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/38px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/50px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quil\">Quil</a> outside of playing as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" title=\"Dark Urge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark Urge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a> origin</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2570/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40297/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12683/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1041326/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time